WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
You work Tuesday 6 October from 7 a.m.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Lina's shift is Thursday 8 October from 3 p.m.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Approved. Lina covers Tuesday morning.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Has my shift swap with Lina been approved?

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Lina works Tuesday at 7 a.m. You work Thursday at 3 p.m.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Ask first. Then read Saturday 10 a.m. and Monday 2 p.m. back.
